#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:4
msgid "FCCで見る単位胞の取り直し"
msgstr "Changing the Unit Cell for FCC"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:6
msgid ""
"FCCの慣用単位胞と基本単位胞を例に、単位胞を取り直したときに原子位置、結晶方向、 "
"反射指数がどう変わるかを確認し、NumPyで検算する。同じ指数の方向と面法線が基底によっては平行でなくなることも見る。 "
"胞の形だけではブラベー格子型が決まらない例は、次の「\\ :ref:`lt-cell-shape-bravais`\\ 」で扱う。"
msgstr ""
"Using the FCC conventional cell and primitive cell as examples, we "
"examine how atomic positions, crystal directions, and reflection indices "
"change when we choose a different unit cell, and verify the results with "
"NumPy. We also see how the direction and plane normal with the same "
"indices need not be parallel in every basis. The next article, “\\ "
":ref:`Cell Shape and Bravais Lattice Type <lt-cell-shape-bravais>`\\ ,” "
"gives examples in which the shape of the cell alone does not determine "
"the Bravais lattice type."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:10
msgid ""
"**前提知識**: :ref:`格子の基底変換<lt-primitive-basis>`、:ref:`超胞<lt-supercell>`、 "
":ref:`逆格子の変換則<lt-reciprocal-transform>`、 :ref:`中心並進<centring-"
"translation>`、:ref:`中心並進のある胞の逆格子<centred-reciprocal-lattice>`、 "
":ref:`方向と格子面<crystal-directions-planes>`。"
msgstr ""
"**Prerequisites**: :ref:`Lattice basis transformations <lt-primitive-"
"basis>`, :ref:`supercells <lt-supercell>`, :ref:`reciprocal lattice "
"transformation rules <lt-reciprocal-transform>`, :ref:`centering "
"translations <centring-translation>`, :ref:`the reciprocal lattice of a "
"centered cell <centred-reciprocal-lattice>`, and :ref:`directions and "
"lattice planes <crystal-directions-planes>`."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:15
msgid "**学習目標**:"
msgstr "**Learning objectives**:"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:17
msgid "FCCの慣用単位胞と基本単位胞の間で、原子位置・方向指数・反射指数を変換する。"
msgstr ""
"Transform atomic positions, direction indices, and reflection indices "
"between the FCC conventional cell and primitive cell."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:18
msgid "同じ指数の方向と面法線が、基底によっては平行にならないことを確かめる。"
msgstr ""
"Verify that the direction and plane normal with the same indices may not "
"be parallel, depending on the basis."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:19
msgid "単位胞の変換と超胞を数値で検算する。"
msgstr "Check unit cell transformations and supercell construction numerically."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:24
msgid "FCCの慣用単位胞と基本単位胞"
msgstr "Conventional Cell and Primitive Cell for FCC"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:26
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"一辺 :math:`a` の立方慣用単位胞をCartesian軸に沿って置くと :math:`A_{\\rm c}=aI` "
"である。FCC（F中心立方）格子の基本並進ベクトルの組の一例は"
msgstr ""
"Align the cubic conventional cell of side length :math:`a` with the "
"Cartesian axes to obtain :math:`A_{\\rm c}=aI`. One choice of primitive "
"translation vectors for the FCC (face-centered cubic) lattice is"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:28
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A_{\\rm p}=A_{\\rm c}P_{\\rm F},\\qquad\n"
"P_{\\rm F}=\\frac12\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"1&0&1\\\\\n"
"1&1&0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}."
msgstr ""
"A_{\\rm p}=A_{\\rm c}P_{\\rm F},\\qquad\n"
"P_{\\rm F}=\\frac12\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"1&0&1\\\\\n"
"1&1&0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"この列はそれぞれ :math:`\\frac a2(0,1,1)`、:math:`\\frac a2(1,0,1)`、:math:`\\frac "
"a2(1,1,0)` である。:math:`\\det P_{\\rm F}=1/4` なので :math:`V_{\\rm "
"c}=a^3`、:math:`V_{\\rm p}=a^3/4`。3本の基本並進ベクトルの長さは :math:`a/\\sqrt2`、相互の角度は"
" :math:`60^\\circ` である。"
msgstr ""
"The columns are :math:`\\frac a2(0,1,1)`, :math:`\\frac a2(1,0,1)`, and "
":math:`\\frac a2(1,1,0)`, respectively. Since :math:`\\det P_{\\rm "
"F}=1/4`, the volumes are :math:`V_{\\rm c}=a^3` and :math:`V_{\\rm "
"p}=a^3/4`. All three primitive translation vectors have length "
":math:`a/\\sqrt2` and make angles of :math:`60^\\circ` with each other."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:40
msgid ""
"F中心慣用単位胞には、原点に加えて分率座標 "
":math:`(0,1/2,1/2)`、:math:`(1/2,0,1/2)`、:math:`(1/2,1/2,0)` の格子点がある（\\ "
":ref:`中心並進<centring-translation>`）。単原子FCCでは慣用単位胞に4格子点、基本単位胞に1格子点が含まれる。"
msgstr ""
"In addition to the origin, the F-centered conventional cell has lattice "
"points at fractional coordinates :math:`(0,1/2,1/2)`, "
":math:`(1/2,0,1/2)`, and :math:`(1/2,1/2,0)` (see \\ :ref:`centering "
"translations <centring-translation>`). For monatomic FCC, the "
"conventional cell contains four lattice points and the primitive cell "
"contains one."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:42
msgid "FCCの慣用立方胞と菱面体基本単位胞を同じCartesian軸上に重ねた図"
msgstr ""
"The FCC conventional cubic cell and rhombohedral primitive cell are "
"overlaid on the same Cartesian axes."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:48
msgid ""
"青線は慣用立方胞（破線は奥の辺）、赤線は同じFCC格子を張る基本単位胞。黒丸は立方体の頂点、白丸は6つの面心の格子点で、基本単位胞の頂点 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2` などは反対側の面心に一致する。表示は三次元構造の正射影である。"
msgstr ""
"The blue lines show the conventional cubic cell (dashed lines mark the "
"back edges), and the red lines show the primitive cell that spans the "
"same FCC lattice. Filled black circles mark the cube vertices and open "
"circles mark the six face-centered lattice points. Vertices of the "
"primitive cell such as :math:`\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2` coincide"
" with the centers of the opposite faces. The figure is an orthographic "
"projection of the three-dimensional structure."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:53
