#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:64
msgid "原点と整数格子並進だけ異なるため、基本単位胞内では同じ格子点に重なる。胞を小さくする際にはこの周期同値性を用いて重複を除く。"
msgstr ""
"This point differs from the origin only by an integer lattice "
"translation, so the two positions coincide in the primitive cell. Use "
"this periodic equivalence to remove duplicates when reducing the cell."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"方向の指数も基底に依存する。慣用立方軸に沿う方向 :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` の旧基底成分は "
":math:`\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm c}=(0,0,1)^{\\mathsf T}` であり、基本並進ベクトルの組では"
msgstr ""
"Direction indices also depend on the basis. The direction "
":math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` along a conventional cubic axis has components "
":math:`\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm c}=(0,0,1)^{\\mathsf T}` in the old basis. In"
" the basis of primitive translation vectors,"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm p}=P_{\\rm F}^{-1}\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm c}\n"
"=(1,1,-1)^{\\mathsf T}."
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm p}=P_{\\rm F}^{-1}\\boldsymbol u_{\\rm c}\n"
"=(1,1,-1)^{\\mathsf T}."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"すなわち :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` は :math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}` "
"である。これは方向そのものが変わったのではなく、同じ方向ベクトルを異なる格子基底の係数で書いた結果である。Cartesian :math:`z` "
"軸と慣用軸が揃うこの例では :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` は :math:`z_{\\rm Cartesian}` "
"に平行だが、基本並進ベクトルの組の :math:`[001]_{\\rm p}` とは平行でない。"
msgstr ""
"Thus :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` is :math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}`. The "
"direction vector stays the same, but a different lattice basis gives it "
"different coefficients. In this example the Cartesian :math:`z` axis "
"aligns with a conventional axis, so :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` is parallel to"
" :math:`z_{\\rm Cartesian}` but is not parallel to :math:`[001]_{\\rm p}`"
" in the basis of primitive translation vectors."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:75
msgid "慣用基底の[001]方向、Cartesianのz軸、基本並進ベクトルの組の[001]方向の違い"
msgstr ""
"Comparison of the [001] direction in the conventional basis, the "
"Cartesian z axis, and the [001] direction in the basis of primitive "
"translation vectors"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:81
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"青矢印は :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` で、Cartesian :math:`z` 軸に平行。基本並進ベクトルの組では "
":math:`\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2-\\boldsymbol a_3`\\ "
"（灰色の破線）と書けるので :math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}` である。赤矢印の :math:`[001]_{\\rm "
"p}=\\boldsymbol a_3=\\frac a2(1,1,0)` は別の方向を指す。"
msgstr ""
"The blue arrow is :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}`, parallel to the Cartesian "
":math:`z` axis. In the basis of primitive translation vectors it is "
":math:`\\boldsymbol a_1+\\boldsymbol a_2-\\boldsymbol a_3` \\ (gray "
"dashed line), so its indices are :math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}`. The red "
"arrow, :math:`[001]_{\\rm p}=\\boldsymbol a_3=\\frac a2(1,1,0)`, points "
"in a different direction."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:83
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"同じ指数の方向と面法線は、基底によっては平行にならない（\\ :ref:`方向と面法線が平行になる条件<direction-and-plane-"
"normal>`）。 立方晶の直交慣用基底では、:math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` と、FCCの格子面の組 "
":math:`(002)_{\\rm c}`\\ （\\ :ref:`指数の共通因子<index-common-factor>`）の法線はともに "
":math:`z` 軸を向く。 一方、基本並進ベクトルの組では、:math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}` が :math:`z`"
" 軸を向くのに対し、 :math:`(11\\bar{1})_{\\rm p}` の法線は :math:`(-1,-1,3)` "
"の向きで、なす角の余弦は :math:`3/\\sqrt{11}\\simeq0.905` である。"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the basis, a direction and a plane normal with the same "
"indices need not be parallel (see \\ :ref:`the condition for a direction "
"and a plane normal to be parallel <direction-and-plane-normal>`). In the "
"orthogonal conventional cubic basis, both :math:`[001]_{\\rm c}` and the "
"normal to the FCC lattice planes :math:`(002)_{\\rm c}` \\ (see \\ "
":ref:`common factors in the indices <index-common-factor>`) point along "
"the :math:`z` axis. In the basis of primitive translation vectors, by "
"contrast, :math:`[11\\bar{1}]_{\\rm p}` points along the :math:`z` axis, "
"but the normal to :math:`(11\\bar{1})_{\\rm p}` points along "
":math:`(-1,-1,3)`. The cosine of the angle between them is "
":math:`3/\\sqrt{11}\\simeq0.905`."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:91
msgid "FCCの反射指数と基本単位胞"
msgstr "FCC Reflection Indices and the Primitive Cell"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":ref:`中心並進のある胞の逆格子<centred-reciprocal-lattice>`\\ では、FCCの慣用指数 "
":math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}` "
"が逆格子ベクトルに対応する条件を、面心並進の分率座標から導いた。基本並進ベクトルの組へ移すと、同じ条件が指数の整数性として現れる。\\ "
":ref:`逆格子の変換則<lt-reciprocal-transform>` :math:`B'=BP^{-\\mathsf T}` から"
msgstr ""
"In the section on :ref:`the reciprocal lattice of a centered cell "
"<centred-reciprocal-lattice>`\\ , we used the fractional coordinates of "
"the face-centering translations to derive the condition for FCC "
"conventional indices :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}` to correspond to a "
"reciprocal lattice vector. In the basis of primitive translation vectors,"
" the same condition requires integer indices. Applying the \\ "
":ref:`reciprocal lattice transformation rule <lt-reciprocal-transform>` "
":math:`B'=BP^{-\\mathsf T}` gives"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm p}=P_{\\rm F}^{\\mathsf T}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c},\n"
"\\qquad B_{\\rm c}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}=B_{\\rm p}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm "
"p}."
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm p}=P_{\\rm F}^{\\mathsf T}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c},\n"
"\\qquad B_{\\rm c}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}=B_{\\rm p}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm "
"p}."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:100
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`B_{\\rm p}` の整数結合が逆格子なので、:math:`B_{\\rm c}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}`"
" が逆格子ベクトルとなるのは :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm p}` が整数のとき、すなわち慣用指数 "
":math:`(hkl)` がすべて偶数またはすべて奇数のときで、条件 :eq:`centred-reciprocal-condition` "
"と一致する。例えば :math:`(100)_{\\rm c}` は :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm "
"p}=(0,1/2,1/2)` で条件を満たさず、:math:`(200)_{\\rm c}` は :math:`\\boldsymbol "
"h_{\\rm p}=(0,1,1)` で条件を満たす。"
msgstr ""
"The reciprocal lattice consists of integer combinations of the columns of"
" :math:`B_{\\rm p}`. Therefore :math:`B_{\\rm c}\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm c}` "
"is a reciprocal lattice vector if and only if :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm"
" p}` has integer components, which is equivalent to the conventional "
"indices :math:`(hkl)` being all even or all odd. This agrees with the "
"condition in Equation :eq:`centred-reciprocal-condition`. For example, "
":math:`(100)_{\\rm c}` gives :math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm p}=(0,1/2,1/2)` "
"and fails the condition, whereas :math:`(200)_{\\rm c}` gives "
":math:`\\boldsymbol h_{\\rm p}=(0,1,1)` and satisfies it."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:108
msgid "|numerical-check|"
msgstr "Numerical Check"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:110
msgid ""
"次の短いNumPy例は、FCC変換、回転、超胞と、逆格子が\\ :ref:`双対基底<reciprocal-basis>`\\ "
"になっていることをまとめて検算する。格子ベクトルは基底変換の式と同様に\\ **列**\\ "
"で保持し、原子座標も列ベクトルとする。格子ベクトルを行に並べるAPIへ渡すときは、\\ :ref:`配列規約<lt-array-"
"conventions>`\\ のとおり転置する。"
msgstr ""
"This short NumPy example checks the FCC transformation, rotation, and "
"supercell construction. It also verifies that the reciprocal lattice "
"vectors form the \\ :ref:`dual basis <reciprocal-basis>` \\ . As in the "
"basis transformation equations, store the lattice vectors as \\ "
"**columns** \\ and use column vectors for atomic coordinates. When "
"passing lattice vectors to an API that stores them in rows, transpose the"
" array according to the \\ :ref:`array layout conventions <lt-array-"
"conventions>`\\ ."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:112
msgid ""
"from itertools import product\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"\n"
"a = 4.0  # Angstrom\n"
"A = a * np.eye(3)\n"
"P = 0.5 * np.array([[0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 1], [1, 1, 0]])\n"
"Ap = A @ P\n"
"assert np.isclose(np.linalg.det(A), 64.0)\n"
"assert np.isclose(abs(np.linalg.det(Ap)), 16.0)\n"
"\n"
"# 基本並進ベクトルの長さと相互の角度\n"
"G = Ap.T @ Ap\n"
"assert np.allclose(np.sqrt(np.diag(G)), 2 * np.sqrt(2))\n"
"assert np.isclose(np.degrees(np.arccos(G[0, 1] / G[0, 0])), 60.0)\n"
"\n"
"# 面心位置と方向の基本並進ベクトルの組表示\n"
"s_primitive = np.linalg.solve(P, np.array([0.0, 0.5, 0.5]))\n"
"u_primitive = np.linalg.solve(P, np.array([0.0, 0.0, 1.0]))\n"
"assert np.allclose(s_primitive, [1, 0, 0])\n"
"assert np.allclose(u_primitive, [1, 1, -1])\n"
"\n"
"# 逆格子と、同じ指数の方向・面法線のなす角\n"
"Bp = 2 * np.pi * np.linalg.inv(Ap).T\n"
"assert np.allclose(Ap.T @ Bp, 2 * np.pi * np.eye(3))\n"
"d, n = Ap @ [1, 1, -1], Bp @ [1, 1, -1]\n"
"assert np.isclose(d @ n / np.linalg.norm(d) / np.linalg.norm(n), 3 / "
"np.sqrt(11))\n"
"\n"
"# z軸まわりの任意角の回転\n"
"theta = 0.37\n"
"Q = np.array([[np.cos(theta), -np.sin(theta), 0],\n"
"              [np.sin(theta),  np.cos(theta), 0],\n"
"              [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"assert np.allclose(Q.T @ Q, np.eye(3))\n"
"assert np.allclose((Q @ Ap).T @ (Q @ Ap), G)\n"
"\n"
"# 超胞: 12個の周期像と、周期境界込みの最短原子間距離\n"
"M = np.diag([2, 3, 2])\n"
"As = Ap @ M\n"
"assert np.isclose(abs(np.linalg.det(As)), 12 * 16.0)\n"
"S = [np.linalg.solve(M, n) for n in product(range(2), range(3), "
"range(2))]\n"
"assert len(S) == 12\n"
"d_min = min(np.linalg.norm(As @ (sj - si + np.array(n)))\n"
"            for i, si in enumerate(S) for j, sj in enumerate(S)\n"
"            for n in product(range(-1, 2), repeat=3)\n"
"            if not (i == j and n == (0, 0, 0)))\n"
"assert np.isclose(d_min, 2 * np.sqrt(2))"
msgstr ""
"from itertools import product\n"
"import numpy as np\n"
"\n"
"a = 4.0  # Angstrom\n"
"A = a * np.eye(3)\n"
"P = 0.5 * np.array([[0, 1, 1], [1, 0, 1], [1, 1, 0]])\n"
"Ap = A @ P\n"
"assert np.isclose(np.linalg.det(A), 64.0)\n"
"assert np.isclose(abs(np.linalg.det(Ap)), 16.0)\n"
"\n"
"# Lengths and mutual angles of the primitive translation vectors\n"
"G = Ap.T @ Ap\n"
"assert np.allclose(np.sqrt(np.diag(G)), 2 * np.sqrt(2))\n"
"assert np.isclose(np.degrees(np.arccos(G[0, 1] / G[0, 0])), 60.0)\n"
"\n"
"# Face-center position and direction in the primitive basis\n"
"s_primitive = np.linalg.solve(P, np.array([0.0, 0.5, 0.5]))\n"
"u_primitive = np.linalg.solve(P, np.array([0.0, 0.0, 1.0]))\n"
"assert np.allclose(s_primitive, [1, 0, 0])\n"
"assert np.allclose(u_primitive, [1, 1, -1])\n"
"\n"
"# Reciprocal lattice and angle between a direction and a plane normal "
"with the same indices\n"
"Bp = 2 * np.pi * np.linalg.inv(Ap).T\n"
"assert np.allclose(Ap.T @ Bp, 2 * np.pi * np.eye(3))\n"
"d, n = Ap @ [1, 1, -1], Bp @ [1, 1, -1]\n"
"assert np.isclose(d @ n / np.linalg.norm(d) / np.linalg.norm(n), 3 / "
"np.sqrt(11))\n"
"\n"
"# Rotation about the z axis by an arbitrary angle\n"
"theta = 0.37\n"
"Q = np.array([[np.cos(theta), -np.sin(theta), 0],\n"
"              [np.sin(theta),  np.cos(theta), 0],\n"
"              [0, 0, 1]])\n"
"assert np.allclose(Q.T @ Q, np.eye(3))\n"
"assert np.allclose((Q @ Ap).T @ (Q @ Ap), G)\n"
"\n"
"# Supercell: 12 periodic images and the shortest interatomic distance "
"including periodic boundaries\n"
"M = np.diag([2, 3, 2])\n"
"As = Ap @ M\n"
"assert np.isclose(abs(np.linalg.det(As)), 12 * 16.0)\n"
"S = [np.linalg.solve(M, n) for n in product(range(2), range(3), "
"range(2))]\n"
"assert len(S) == 12\n"
"d_min = min(np.linalg.norm(As @ (sj - si + np.array(n)))\n"
"            for i, si in enumerate(S) for j, sj in enumerate(S)\n"
"            for n in product(range(-1, 2), repeat=3)\n"
"            if not (i == j and n == (0, 0, 0)))\n"
"assert np.isclose(d_min, 2 * np.sqrt(2))"

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:161
msgid ""
"行列式から慣用単位胞 :math:`64\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3`、基本単位胞 "
":math:`16\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3`、超胞 "
":math:`192\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3` を得る。FCC基本並進ベクトル長は "
":math:`4/\\sqrt2=2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}`、相互の角度は "
":math:`60^\\circ`、面心点は基本単位胞の分率座標 :math:`(1,0,0)`、方向は :math:`(1,1,-1)` "
"となる。任意角（例では :math:`\\theta=0.37` rad）の回転で計量行列は変わらず、逆格子は :math:`A_{\\rm "
"p}^{\\mathsf T}B_{\\rm p}=2\\pi I` を満たす。:math:`[11\\bar1]_{\\rm p}` と "
":math:`(11\\bar1)_{\\rm p}` の法線のなす角の余弦は :math:`3/\\sqrt{11}` "
"である。12個の周期像を作ると原子数が12倍になり、超胞周期境界も含めた最短原子間距離は "
":math:`2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}` で元のFCC最近接距離と一致する。"
msgstr ""
"The determinants give volumes of :math:`64\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3` "
"for the conventional cell, :math:`16\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3` for the"
" primitive cell, and :math:`192\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}^3` for the "
"supercell. The FCC primitive translation vectors have length "
":math:`4/\\sqrt2=2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}` and mutual angles of"
" :math:`60^\\circ`. The face center has primitive cell fractional "
"coordinates :math:`(1,0,0)`, and the direction has components "
":math:`(1,1,-1)`. Rotating by an arbitrary angle (:math:`\\theta=0.37` "
"rad in the example) leaves the metric matrix unchanged, and the "
"reciprocal lattice satisfies :math:`A_{\\rm p}^{\\mathsf T}B_{\\rm "
"p}=2\\pi I`. The cosine of the angle between :math:`[11\\bar1]_{\\rm p}` "
"and the normal to :math:`(11\\bar1)_{\\rm p}` is :math:`3/\\sqrt{11}`. "
"Generating 12 periodic images increases the atom count by a factor of 12."
" The minimum interatomic distance including the periodic boundaries of "
"the supercell is :math:`2\\sqrt2\\,\\mathrm{\\mathring{A}}`, equal to the"
" original FCC nearest-neighbor distance."

#: ../../solid/unitcell_transform.rst:163
msgid "この例は代数恒等式を検算するものであり、特定の計算コードのファイル読込や、任意の非対角超胞での周期像列挙までは検証しない。実計算に接続するときは、原子種・占有率・単位・境界条件も含む構造全体で照合する。"
msgstr ""
"This example verifies algebraic identities but does not test file reading"
" in a particular calculation code or enumeration of periodic images for "
"arbitrary nondiagonal supercells. When using the result in an actual "
"calculation, check the entire structure, including species, occupancies, "
"units, and boundary conditions."

